    "expansionRule": "\"createRequestFrom\": \"G1-asset-class\" means the G1 createRequest.newRecordType, with only the members listed under \"replace\" substituted wholesale. Arrays are replaced as a whole, never merged. This is a fixture notation, not a runtime patch protocol.",
    "host": "RecordTypeDefinitionStoreTests.Host() with no registry options (RecordTypeDefinitionStoreTests.cs:555-576): tenant tenant-a, window (1,0,1), class eam.equipment published, kinds as in records-current-grammar testHostKindRegistry.",
